# H hand-off: /mobile is not native in mantle, so it opens in Claude Code.
name: handoff
size: 100x30
args: --permission-mode default
prompt: Say hello
files: ../../../testdata/fixtures/12/app
script: scripts/handoff.json
parity: SE-40, AC-22, CL-04
---
ready
wait_for 30s Hello from the fake model.
wait_gone 30s esc to interrupt
type /mobile
keys enter
# mantle asks before handing the terminal to Claude Code.
@mantle wait_for 10s Open in Claude Code
@mantle keys enter
wait_for 30s claude.ai/mobile
settle 3s
checkpoint panel
